MIRAGE-SIGNATURE: ^String ImageDataBuffer::ToDataURL\(
MIRAGE-VERIFY: Confirm the exact ToDataURL head in this tag (parameter list, constness, owning class) and fix FROM if needed.
MIRAGE-VERIFY: Confirm the API exposing the mutable encoder-input pixel buffer (Pixmap() / pixmap_ / data_ / Pixels()) and adjust the access lines inside the markers; keep the mirage:: call unchanged.
